# Contributor-local editor / agent settings (must live in-repo; a global
# ignore only covers the owner machine). settings.json IS tracked — it holds
# this repo's local orchestration hooks, and the publish export drops .claude/
# wholesale, so nothing here reaches the public tree by being versioned.
